{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13750","headline":"苔藓山歌 · 顾况","name":"苔藓山歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野人夜梦江南山，江南山深松桂闲。\n野人觉後长叹息，帖藓黏苔作山色。\n闭门无事任盈虚，终日欹眠观四如。\n一如白云飞出壁，二如飞雨岩前滴。\n三如腾虎欲咆哮，四如嬾龙遭霹雳。\n嶮峭嵌空潭洞寒，小儿两手扶栏干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}